  "execution_status": "not_run_in_this_delivery",
  "requirements": "# Compressed-air pressure feedforward PI\n\n- **Difficulty:** Hard (hard)\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. Implement FB_CompressorPressure using LREAL. PressureKpa must be 0..1000 kPa, AirUseFlow 0..90 Nm3/min, Kp 0..1 percent/kPa, Ki 0..0.1 percent/(kPa*s), and DtSec 0.001..1 seconds. All real inputs are finite.\n\n2. The pressure target is 500 kPa. Let e=500-PressureKpa and feedforward FF=2*AirUseFlow, where 2 has units percent/(Nm3/min). CapacityPct is the compressor capacity setpoint in 0..100 percent; it does not report whether actual pressure has reached the target.\n\n3. Initially Integral=0 and CapacityPct=0. Reset has highest priority: clear Integral and CapacityPct, set Saturated=FALSE and Error=FALSE, and ignore other inputs. When Enable=FALSE, preserve Integral, output zero CapacityPct and clear both flags.\n\n4. On a legal enabled call, compute Ic=previous_Integral+Ki*e*DtSec and Uc=FF+Kp*e+Ic. Reject this integration step when (Uc>100 AND e>0) OR (Uc<0 AND e<0), preserving previous_Integral; otherwise accept Ic. Recompute U=FF+Kp*e+Integral using the final integral, then set CapacityPct=LIMIT(0,U,100).\n\n5. Saturated is TRUE only when U is strictly below 0 or above 100; equality at either boundary is not saturation. Illegal inputs during enabled operation set Error=TRUE, CapacityPct=0 and Saturated=FALSE while preserving Integral. A legal enabled call clears Error. The absolute integral remains below or equal to 1e9 over the benchmark run. Use absolute numeric tolerance 1e-6.\n\n6. Only evaluate the setpoint computation and anti-windup state behavior. A storage-vessel plant model, compressor start/stop sequencing and surge protection are outside scope.\n\n## Interface Definition\n\n| Direction | Variable/Field | Data Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Input | `Enable` | `BOOL` | Enable controller computation. |\n| Input | `Reset` | `BOOL` | Clear the integral; highest priority. |\n| Input | `PressureKpa` | `LREAL` | Header pressure, 0..1000 kPa. |\n| Input | `AirUseFlow` | `LREAL` | Air consumption, 0..90 Nm3/min. |\n| Input | `Kp` | `LREAL` | Proportional gain, 0..1 percent/kPa. |\n| Input | `Ki` | `LREAL` | Integral gain, 0..0.1 percent/(kPa*s). |\n| Input | `DtSec` | `LREAL` | Actual invocation interval, 0.001..1 s. |\n| Output | `CapacityPct` | `LREAL` | Compressor capacity setpoint, 0..100 percent. |\n| Output | `Integral` | `LREAL` | Integral state, externally read-only. |\n| Output | `Saturated` | `BOOL` | Final unclamped output is strictly outside 0..100. |\n| Output | `Error` | `BOOL` | Illegal enabled-operation input. |",
  "ltl": {
    "id": "CUSTOM_06",
    "title": "压缩空气母管压力的用气前馈调节",
    "definitions": "独立观察器积分I初始0。valid := PressureKpa∈[0,1000] AND AirUseFlow∈[0,90] AND Kp∈[0,1] AND Ki∈[0,0.1] AND DtSec∈[0.001,1]，均有限。\nReset最高优先：I=0，u=0，sat=FALSE，err=FALSE。\n否则!Enable：I保持，u=0，sat=FALSE，err=FALSE。\n否则!valid：I保持，u=0，sat=FALSE，err=TRUE。\n合法使能：e=500-PressureKpa，FF=2*AirUseFlow，Ic=pre.I+Ki*e*DtSec，Uc=FF+Kp*e+Ic；\nreject := (Uc>100 AND e>0) OR (Uc<0 AND e<0)，I=(reject?pre.I:Ic)，U=FF+Kp*e+I，u=clamp(U,0,100)，sat=(U<0 OR U>100)，err=FALSE。\npressureMatch := Integral=I AND CapacityPct=u AND Saturated=sat AND Error=err。|I|<=1e9为运行域假设；不模拟压力物理演化。\n饱和判断使用最终U，不能用被拒绝积分的Uc代替。",
    "properties": [
      {
        "id": "P01",
        "formula": "G(pressureMatch)"
      },
      {
        "id": "P02",
        "formula": "G(Reset -> (Integral=0 & CapacityPct=0 & !Saturated & !Error))"
      },
      {
        "id": "P03",
        "formula": "G((!Reset & !Enable) -> (Integral=pre.I & CapacityPct=0 & !Saturated & !Error))"
      },
      {
        "id": "P04",
        "formula": "G((!Reset & Enable & !valid) -> (Integral=pre.I & CapacityPct=0 & !Saturated & Error))"
      },
      {
        "id": "P05",
        "formula": "G((!Reset & Enable & valid & reject) -> (Integral=pre.I))"
      },
      {
        "id": "P06",
        "formula": "G((!Reset & Enable & valid) -> (Saturated <-> (U<0 | U>100)))"
      },
      {
        "id": "P07",
        "formula": "G(0<=CapacityPct & CapacityPct<=100)"
      }
    ],
